    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Simulator is a minimalist hand-drawn beat-em-up simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this little game for myself and for you guys, sometimes I just want to beat something up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the game starts, please press any key to start an impromptu beating, and as you beat up more, you can unlock more tags and conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch the color of the character, the color of the blood, the background and the foreground at will during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm <strong>Liujiajun</strong>, this is my <strong>seventh</strong> game on Steam, I hope you like my work and thanks for playing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Simulator is a minimalist hand-drawn beat-em-up simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this little game for myself and for you guys, sometimes I just want to beat something up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the game starts, please press any key to start an impromptu beating, and as you beat up more, you can unlock more tags and conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch the color of the character, the color of the blood, the background and the foreground at will during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm <strong>Liujiajun</strong>, this is my <strong>seventh</strong> game on Steam, I hope you like my work and thanks for playing.</p>",
